# This app currently needs no secrets at all — both data sources
# (adsb.lol/adsb.fi for live position, Caribbean Airlines' own site for
# schedule/status) work without an API key or account.
#
# This file is kept as a placeholder in case you add a secret later
# (e.g. switching to a paid schedule API). Copy it to
# .streamlit/secrets.toml for local development, or paste values into
# Streamlit Community Cloud's Settings -> Secrets. Never commit the real
# secrets.toml — it's gitignored.
